a di parlarti della Castala, devo presentarti qualcuno che è diventato fondamentale nella mia…"><Coding creatingUser="3259B7CC-0F60-4FE3-95C7-C813D9F61B56" creationDateTime="2026-05-07T14:42:48Z" guid="073B56B6-13A6-4E2F-A6EF-4AE35E05B753"><CodeRef targetGUID="CDE1306C-412D-4B99-AF9C-C4E99739683C"></CodeRef></Coding></PlainTextSelection><PlainTextSelection startPosition="2552" modifyingUser="3259B7CC-0F60-4FE3-95C7-C813D9F61B56" modifiedDateTime="2026-05-06T12:41:52Z" creatingUser="3259B7CC-0F60-4FE3-95C7-C813D9F61B56" creationDateTime="2026-05-06T12:41:52Z" endPosition="2769" guid="9F8F213F-F08D-4C21-98EB-D83B2532DA4F" name="a Santa Giustina tutti si conoscono, ma a malapena si salutano. Sembrano accorgersi della tua presen…"><Coding creatingUser="3259B7CC-0F60-4FE3-95C7-C813D9F61B56" creationDateTime="2026-05-06T12:41:52Z" guid="1C45E852-CD3C-4D8C-8438-F1F456D9B7B0"><CodeRef targetGUID="317A78F5-A6A1-4546-9F3B-B51ACB000DD5"></CodeRef></Coding></PlainTextSelection><PlainTextSelection startPosition="1392" modifyingUser="3259B7CC-0F60-4FE3-95C7-C813D9F61B56" modifiedDateTime="2026-04-30T14:48:54Z" creatingUser="3259B7CC-0F60-4FE3-95C7-C813D9F61B56" creationDateTime="2026-04-30T14:48:54Z" endPosition="1519" guid="D3F7C24B-DE42-4A30-A5F7-0B5AD9E5ABAB" name="La vita è molto lenta qui, e abbiamo imparato a fare tesoro di ciò che abbiamo piuttosto che rincorr…"><Coding creatingUser="3259B7CC-0F60-4FE3-95C7-C813D9F61B56" creationDateTime="2026-04-30T14:48:54Z" guid="5A9FFF39-250E-46AE-ACF2-D7FC5FD02FD2"><CodeRef targetGUID="909455C5-A966-4C20-A73A-E1BB71FB73F1"></CodeRef></Coding></PlainTextSelection><PlainTextSelection startPosition="2861" modifyingUser="3259B7CC-0F60-4FE3-95C7-C813D9F61B56" modifiedDateTime="2026-05-06T12:47:49Z" creatingUser="3259B7CC-0F60-4FE3-95C7-C813D9F61B56" creationDateTime="2026-05-06T12:47:49Z" endPosition="2954" guid="BCFFE5D0-4B42-44EB-8FB7-E753E865BEED" name="La città mi piace molto, mi sento bene sapendo che ci sono così tanti stimoli a disposizione."><Coding creatingUser="3259B7CC-0F60-4FE3-95C7-C813D9F61B56" creationDateTime="2026-05-06T12:47:49Z" guid="B8FC651F-9856-4207-BD65-014A80F0E5BD"><CodeRef targetGUID="4FED279A-114D-4F13-B793-588135813131"></CodeRef></Coding></PlainTextSelection><PlainTextSelection startPosition="8652" modifyingUser="3259B7CC-0F60-4FE3-95C7-C813D9F61B56" modifiedDateTime="2026-05-07T14:46:14Z" creatingUser="3259B7CC-0F60-4FE3-95C7-C813D9F61B56" creationDateTime="2026-05-07T14:46:14Z" endPosition="8680" guid="8E72913B-01AB-4F38-A204-CD3C3CACFB08" name="ma Lepi cos'è, un cagnolino?"><Coding creatingUser="3259B7CC-0F60-4FE3-95C7-C813D9F61B56" creationDateTime="2026-05-07T14:46:14Z" guid="A561918B-CA5C-4D97-90A2-7D2A13832452"><CodeRef targetGUID="18B1608D-0083-42FD-9C50-492D55AE06C6"></CodeRef></Coding></PlainTextSelection><PlainTextSelection startPosition="9690" modifyingUser="3259B7CC-0F60-4FE3-95C7-C813D9F61B56" modifiedDateTime="2026-05-07T14:51:52Z" creatingUser="3259B7CC-0F60-4FE3-95C7-C813D9F61B56" creationDateTime="2026-05-07T14:51:52Z" endPosition="9727" guid="7A11A926-B962-4C15-A641-63D74D809F4E" name="È sulla Castala, di cui ti accennavo."><Coding creatingUser="3259B7CC-0F60-4FE3-95C7-C813D9F61B56" creationDateTime="2026-05-07T14:51:52Z" guid="0220AE3A-3FE9-4AF9-9739-6ED60151D73E"><CodeRef targetGUID="42D6DE16-ECDD-4F01-9F3A-1B44FEB414B5"></CodeRef></Coding></PlainTextSelection><PlainTextSelection startPosition="3123" modifyingUser="3259B7CC-0F60-4FE3-95C7-C813D9F61B56" modifiedDateTime="2026-05-06T12:44:16Z" creatingUser="3259B7CC-0F60-4FE3-95C7-C813D9F61B56" creationDateTime="2026-05-06T12:44:16Z" endPosition="3166" guid="8539A788-970E-41DB-84C9-75FD2471033C" name="Caterina (se vuoi puoi darmi un altro nome)"><Coding creatingUser="3259B7CC-0F60-4FE3-95C7-C813D9F61B56" creationDateTime="2026-05-06T12:44:16Z" guid="FE5DC539-CF42-4E69-8DEE-1683098BE97A"><CodeRef targetGUID="C6C31265-093C-43D8-8819-37B10EFF75B6"></CodeRef></Coding></PlainTextSelection><PlainTextSelectio