" modifyingUser="3259B7CC-0F60-4FE3-95C7-C813D9F61B56" modifiedDateTime="2026-05-07T14:55:35Z" creatingUser="3259B7CC-0F60-4FE3-95C7-C813D9F61B56" creationDateTime="2026-05-07T14:55:35Z" endPosition="10592" guid="2455C034-D584-4525-995E-54A568D4ACB7" name="Ma io... io mi sono affezionato a Lepi molto più di quanto pensassi possibile. Lo guardo giocare con…"><Coding creatingUser="3259B7CC-0F60-4FE3-95C7-C813D9F61B56" creationDateTime="2026-05-07T14:55:38Z" guid="CFCAD783-054C-47DF-BF94-AE798D25F177"><CodeRef targetGUID="CDE1306C-412D-4B99-AF9C-C4E99739683C"></CodeRef></Coding><Coding creatingUser="3259B7CC-0F60-4FE3-95C7-C813D9F61B56" creationDateTime="2026-05-07T14:55:35Z" guid="EF33CFE6-7C13-4DAE-86F1-785F8EADBA59"><CodeRef targetGUID="C1596013-CF42-4BE7-9A1E-2B37904D8950"></CodeRef></Coding></PlainTextSelection><PlainTextSelection startPosition="2771" modifyingUser="3259B7CC-0F60-4FE3-95C7-C813D9F61B56" modifiedDateTime="2026-05-06T12:46:11Z" creatingUser="3259B7CC-0F60-4FE3-95C7-C813D9F61B56" creationDateTime="2026-05-06T12:46:11Z" endPosition="3017" guid="772D1D8D-DCDF-4AF2-913B-7A06002C11FC" name="Anche io mi sono spostata, per non dire sono fuggita, varie volte. Ora mi trovo a Torino. La città m…"><Coding creatingUser="3259B7CC-0F60-4FE3-95C7-C813D9F61B56" creationDateTime="2026-05-06T12:46:11Z" guid="3498486E-1685-4595-8A54-4ABF098EEC5C"><CodeRef targetGUID="C1596013-CF42-4BE7-9A1E-2B37904D8950"></CodeRef></Coding></PlainTextSelection><PlainTextSelection startPosition="12543" modifyingUser="3259B7CC-0F60-4FE3-95C7-C813D9F61B56" modifiedDateTime="2026-05-08T15:59:52Z" creatingUser="3259B7CC-0F60-4FE3-95C7-C813D9F61B56" creationDateTime="2026-05-08T15:59:52Z" endPosition="12635" guid="7E70F3FF-8647-435C-AADB-F62314D7D53E" name="L'ho guardato e ho pensato: &quot;Oggi è il giorno&quot;. Avevo lo stomaco chiuso, ma ero determinato."><Coding creatingUser="3259B7CC-0F60-4FE3-95C7-C813D9F61B56" creationDateTime="2026-05-08T15:59:55Z" guid="7CCB167F-C453-4871-92AD-9A6